  <span class="label eyebrow">Research approach</span>
  <h1 id="method-h">How we engineer for uncertainty</h1>
  <p class="standfirst">
    Large-scale engineering systems are committed to for decades, in conditions that cannot be
    forecast with confidence. Our method treats that uncertainty as a design variable, not an
    afterthought.
  </p>
  <p class="supporting">
    Seven principles run through everything we do, applied consistently across our research and
    project work, from lunar resource value-chains to transport and energy infrastructure. This
    page sets them out in full.
  </p>
